<https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf> <http://usefulinc.com/ns/doap#bug-database> <https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/issues> .
<https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf> <http://usefulinc.com/ns/doap#description> "PurRDF built from source commit 77fc58ee4d7b35b21f56b3a434c318168627e2f2, run against the W3C data-shapes test suite at commit 08adb3776709a014bc3062ede793c36275b22446, graded under the shacl-rec-2017-07-20 profile. That law is selectable on every host: `purrdf validate --shacl-profile shacl-rec-2017-07-20` on the command line, and the `shacl_profile` keyword (Python), the `shaclProfile` argument (WebAssembly) and the `shacl_profile` argument of `purrdf_shacl_validate_to_sarif_law` (C)" .
